{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>What is the testimony.</b> The meaning: why is this yoke upon us among the children of men? And you shall say that HaShem redeemed us from the house of slaves, and behold He did this goodness for us, and behold we are obligated to fear His name, for we have already recognized that He did good to us and will yet do good to us, to keep us alive, for His commandments are life to those who find them."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:22:37.489227070Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}